    "created_at": "2021-10-05T10:21:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-05T10:21:20Z",
    "body": "What's the benefit of this over having people use `<dialog>`?\r\n\r\nThere were other problems with these APIs too such as having to rate-limit them and them appearing to be dialogs from the browser rather than the site.",
